00:45:40.479 --> 00:45:42.270
I'm sure the numbers
will change over time,

00:45:42.270 --> 00:45:45.050
but the general implications
of semi-synchronous replication

00:45:45.050 --> 00:45:47.050
and MySQL won't
change nearly as fast.

